WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:42.050
An agreement can appear complete while making promises that nobody has authorised. In this practice, first identify every clause that makes an unsupported or unlimited commitment. Then select one defective clause and write a clearer version in the rewrite box. Explain the permitted work, its limits, the responsible owner and any confirmation still required. Your draft saves automatically. When you compare your rewrite, you will see a possible clause and the important boundaries it preserves. Different wording can be valid. The comparison helps you reflect on your reasoning; it does not automatically mark your writing or award a pass.
